{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Conquering Presence",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use your Channel Divinity to exude a terrifying presence. As an Action, you force each creature of your choice that you can see within 30 feet of you to make a Wisdom Saving Throw. On a failed save, a creature becomes Frightened of you for 1 minute. The Frightened creature can repeat this Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p>",
